8. Overall Activity

The investigation established that BITSAdmin was used to download T1197.md, which was subsequently renamed to bitsadmin1_flag.ps1 and executed. No further related activity was observed in the available logs after execution.

9. Conclusion

The observed behavior is consistent with the use of BITS Jobs (MITRE ATT&CK T1197) as a file-transfer mechanism.

The investigation identified the download and subsequent execution of the renamed PowerShell script but did not identify additional related activity in the available telemetry.

Further investigation would require additional endpoint, PowerShell, process, network, and file-system telemetry to determine whether the script performed any activity that was not captured by the available logs.
